  "validation": "13 current-provider builds through DAG Halt pass; 116 common public type/axiom reports and 29,279 global simp entries match; five unchanged-source clients have identical objects. Six cached provider source/object pairs match earlier receipts.",
  "limitations": [
    "Other upstream project, Foundation and package objects remain cached; this is not a clean full closure or a replay of every downstream client.",
    "Thirteen unstable generated loop proof names disappear; sixteen private helper/auxiliary names are added. Targeted simp probes are empty and reference-search scopes are limited to tracked Lean/Python files and local Lean/tools trees.",
    "The first generic draft failed and its source was overwritten. The first private-name simp probe failed parsing and is retained; neither counts as passing evidence.",
    "The first independent archive check used an incorrect source path and failed after manifest verification; a corrected snapshot check passed. Compiled objects and the original replay environment are excluded."
  ],
